{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46778","headline":"谢贯微上人寄示古风今体四轴 · 齐己","name":"谢贯微上人寄示古风今体四轴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四轴骚词书八行，捧吟肌骨遍清凉。\n谩求龙树能医眼，休问图澄学洗肠。\n今体尽搜初剖判，古风淳凿未玄黄。\n不知谁肯降文阵，闇点旌旗敌子房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}